# Force the old Netlify default subdomain to the real custom domain (Jorge's ask 2026-10-15) --
# Netlify keeps serving amansala-portal.netlify.app side by side with amansalaportal.com even
# after the custom domain was added, so an old link/bookmark still worked but showed the wrong
# URL. Must stay first so it wins over every other rule below for that host.
https://amansala-portal.netlify.app/*  https://amansalaportal.com/:splat  301!

# Spa-only staff link (Rosy/Kike/Host/Rubi etc.) -- redirects to booking-hub.html
# in spa-staff mode (own login, no access to the rest of the portal). Must be
# a real redirect (302), not a 200 rewrite -- a rewrite keeps the URL bar as
# /spa-staff with no query string, so the page's JS never sees ?mode=spa-staff
# and falls through to the main admin login instead. Must also come before
# the catch-all shortlink rule below so it isn't swallowed by it.
/spa-staff  /booking-hub.html?mode=spa-staff  302

# Public spa booking link for the 60 minute Crystal Balancing offer (service flagged offer=crystal). A 302, like /spa-staff, so the page sees ?offer=crystal.
/spa-crystal  /spa-booking.html  302
/crystal  /spa-booking.html  302

# Clean public link for the general spa booking page (no login). A rewrite keeps the short URL.
/spa  /spa-booking.html  200
/book-spa  /spa-booking.html  200

